sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant D as Sorting Device
    participant H as Edge SignalR Host
    participant A as Edge Application
    participant DB as SQLite Journal/Outbox
    participant P as Postal Systems
    participant C as Core Gateway/APIs

    D->>H: Auth envelope
    H->>A: Authenticate device and bind connection
    A->>DB: Read configuration / write session
    DB-->>A: Device verifier and session state
    A-->>H: Auth status 0 or 2
    H-->>D: SessionId and edgeServerTime

    D->>H: RegisterInbound with operationId
    H->>A: Validated application request
    A->>DB: Check operation journal
    alt Replay
        DB-->>A: Stored response
    else New operation
        A->>DB: Commit external-operation intent
        DB-->>A: Intent durable before side effect
        A->>P: Lookup/register with timeout
        alt Definitive upstream response
            P-->>A: Success, explicit pending or terminal receipt
            A->>DB: Persist receipt immediately
            A->>DB: Finalize state + journal + outbox
            DB-->>A: Commit acknowledged
        else Timeout / commit unknown
            A->>DB: Preserve intent as manual reconciliation
            A-->>H: Safe Error (no blind external retry)
        end
    end
    A-->>H: Domain result
    H-->>D: Device V1 response

    loop Background delivery
        A->>DB: Claim due outbox row
        A->>C: Versioned event with idempotency key
        C-->>A: Durable acknowledgment
        A->>DB: Mark published
    end
